# Roboter Studio named-object grasping: return the object catalog's type list
# for the Blockly dropdowns. type_names[i] is the internal type key (the block
# field value); labels_de[i] is its German display label (parallel arrays). On
# an absent / corrupt / invalid catalog the arrays are empty, success is false,
# and message carries the German reason. The service reads the catalog JSON from
# the edubotics_calib volume at call time (edit + re-fetch, no image rebuild).
---
string[] type_names
string[] labels_de
bool success
string message
